  "scientific_reading": [
    "Paired within-original-bat high vs moderate success proportion lower in five of six eligible bats; one tie and none higher.",
    "Source high density observed in eight bats but only six have high-density attacks, highlighting selection into attempting.",
    "Within-bat-time third assignment keeps all 36 high-density attacks in nine matched time strata from six bats.",
    "The 2024 source already published negative effect on success conditional on attack with bat random effects; this is narrow postpublication support assessment, not independent discovery.",
    "Source original study outcome has only 10 biological animals and one flight per bat; 4299 windows are dependent within animal.",
    "Source exact conditional probability assumes exchangeability of successes within bats and time strata; serial dependence/observational density invalidate causal interpretations.",
    "No original receiver false alarm, acoustic spectral masking, encounter prey density or real neighboring bat head counts available.",
    "Nine-bat sensitivity reuses same six attempt-eligible bats and is not an independent replicate."
  ],
